      "type": "filename_convention",
      "description": "Missing underscore between subject ID and cohort: 'ID22hc' where every other file uses 'ID<NN>_<hc|pd>'. The audio itself is valid 24-bit PCM.",
      "action_required": "Phase 2B must parse subject IDs with a tolerant matcher (e.g. regex r'ID(\\d+)') rather than str.split('_')[0]. A naive split would mint a phantom subject 'ID22hc', splitting ID22's recordings across folds and leaking the subject between train and test in grouped cross-validation."
    }
